### 10.3 API Handler — Zod discriminated union per playType

```typescript
// Mỗi playType có schema riêng, validated qua z.discriminatedUnion("playType")
z.discriminatedUnion("playType", [
  pick1Schema, pick2Schema, ..., pick10Schema,
  bigSmallBoardSchema,
  evenOddBoardSchema,
]);
```

boardNo: "A" | "B" | "C" — tối đa 3 boards, không trùng boardNo.
Request body: `{ drawIds, boards }` — KHÔNG CÒN `sideBets`.

